            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit gin acel ma otimme i kom Codom ki Gomora-ni i kare ma gin ki gaŋi ma gitye i netgl-gu gityekogi woko bitimme bene i kom Edom. Ŋat mo ma bibedo kunnu pe, kadi bed pi kare mo manok keken. An Rwot, doŋ aloko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, abibino macalo labwor ma bino i dye olet romi kun a ki i buŋa ma yatte oculle Likiŋ ma tye i dog kulu Jordan, abimiyo jo Edom giriŋo woko ki i lobogi, Doŋ lacen dano mo ma ayero ni obed latel aye biloyo rok meno. Aŋa ma gitwero poro ki an? Aŋa ma twero ette ka lwoŋa pi lweny? Kit lakwat aŋo mono ma twero cuŋ i nyima? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi meno, doŋ wuwiny kit yub ma an Rwot, doŋ atyeko yubone i kom jo Edom, ki gin ma doŋ ayubbe me timone i kom jo ma bedo i gaŋ me Teman. Kadi bed wa litinogi gibiywayogi woko, ci bimiyo dano ducu gibedo ki ur matek i kom can meno mupoto i komgi-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Edom opoto ci morre bimiyo lobo yeŋŋe, ki koko oduru bene biwinnye ka mabor wa i Nam Makwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, lamerok bibino lwenyo i kom Bojra calo ocur ma tuk ki malo i pol Lyanne piny ma noŋo oyaro bwome woko. I nino meno lulweny me Edom cwinygi bibedo ki lworo calo cwiny dako ma tye ka reŋi ki nywal.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
